GAMEOVER_LASERS=Shortly after the alarm is triggered,\nthe police arrest you for trespassing.\nYour sentence will be light, but it\nwill prevent you from ever finding\nSophie again. 
GAMEOVER_FALLENDOWN=As you enter the chasm, you slip.\nThe fall is so terrible that\nyou shatter your limbs. 
