ENDING_SCENE_1=As you cross this final threshold,\nyou discover horror and wonder... 
ENDING_SCENE_2=You save Sophie from certain death.\n
ENDING_SCENE_3=She is a little weak, but alive.\n
ENDING_SCENE_4=He wanted to do to me what he did to\nall those poor people!', she says.\n
ENDING_SCENE_5='It's over... it's over...',\nyou reply with relief. 
ENDING_SCENE_6=At your call, the police discovered\n518 people in cryogenic suspension.\nThe world's leading scientific experts\nwere summoned.\nTo their great astonishment,\nall 518 people were found\nsafe and sound. 
ENDING_SCENE_7=Had science taken a step forward\nin the quest for eternal survival?\nWho was this enigmatic Professor\nTcherslawsky, responsible for a true\ncrime against humanity?\nHe had vanished without a trace.\nWhere had this strange substance,\nin which the victims lay, come from? 
